<title>DUBAI: Iraq said to repair damaged sites in south.</title>
<headline>Iraq said to repair damaged sites in south.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A United States official on Tuesday said there were signs that Iraq was repairing some air defence sites hit by U.S. cruise missile strikes last week.</p>
<p>&quot;There are indications that Iraq is repairing or reconstituting some sites that were hit,&quot; the official who requested anonymity told Reuters.</p>
</text>
